    "name": "### Topic: Piaget's Stages Memory Trick - SPCF (पियाजे की अवस्थाओं को याद रखने की ट्रिक)",
    "description": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>Piaget's SPCF Memory Trick</title>\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts & Font Awesome Icons -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" />\n\n    <style>\n        /* ─── Modern Global Reset ─── */\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, #fcfaff 0%, #f4ebff 50%, #e9daff 100%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            padding: 3rem 1.5rem;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Premium Glassmorphism Card ─── */\n        .psych-card {\n            max-width: 950px;\n            width: 100%;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            border-radius: 32px;\n            padding: 3rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -15px rgba(108, 60, 176, 0.15),\n                        0 8px 30px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02),\n                        inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 640px) {\n            body { padding: 1rem 0.75rem; }\n            .psych-card { padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 24px; }\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Header Elements ─── */\n        .header-badge {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #793fc6 0%, #5d2b9f 100%);\n            color: #fff;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n            padding: 0.45rem 1.2rem;\n            border-radius: 100px;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px -4px rgba(121, 63, 198, 0.3);\n        }\n\n        .topic-title {\n            font-size: 1.75rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n            line-height: 1.25;\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .topic-title span.accent {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c3cb0, #9f6ee3);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n        }\n\n        .topic-title span.hindi-title {\n            font-size: 1.15rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #6a598c;\n            display: inline-block;\n            margin-left: 0.5rem;\n            letter-spacing: 0;\n        }\n\n        .topic-sub {\n            color: #5c4d7d;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .topic-sub::before {\n            content: '';\n            display: block;\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 18px;\n            background: #9f6ee3;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Formula Box ─── */\n        .formula-box {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 2rem;\n            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(121, 63, 198, 0.08);\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(108, 60, 176, 0.03);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .formula-box .f-label {\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n            color: #793fc6;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .math-equation {\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .math-equation span.step {\n            background: #f4f0fa;\n            padding: 0.4rem 1rem;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(121, 63, 198, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .math-equation span.arrow {\n            color: #9f6ee3;\n        }\n\n        .math-sub-timeline {\n            font-size: 0.88rem;\n            color: #6a598c;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 2.8rem;\n            margin-top: 0.25rem;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Grid Breakdown ─── */\n        .breakdown-title {\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .breakdown-title i { color: #793fc6; }\n\n        .school-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 1.25rem;\n            margin-bottom: 3rem;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .school-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n            .math-sub-timeline { display: none; }\n        }\n\n        .school-card {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(220, 208, 238, 0.4);\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.01);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .school-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: #793fc6;\n        }\n\n        .school-card .s-letter {\n            font-weight: 800;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .school-card .s-letter .badge {\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            background: #f4f0fa;\n            color: #793fc6;\n            padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .school-card .s-stage-name {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #4a3e65;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .school-card .s-detail {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .school-card .bullet {\n            font-size: 0.88rem;\n            color: #5c4d7d;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            gap: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .school-card .bullet i {\n            color: #9f6ee3;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Extra Mnemonics Section ─── */\n        .extra-section {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: 24px;\n            padding: 2rem;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(220, 208, 238, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .extra-section .extra-title {\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .extra-section .extra-title i { color: #10b981; }\n\n        .phrase-list {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n            padding-left: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .phrase-item {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: #1a0b36;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .phrase-item i {\n            color: #10b981;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .phrase-item span.highlight-words strong {\n            color: #793fc6;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #e9daff;\n        }\n\n        /* ─── Footer Style ─── */\n        .footer-note {\n            margin-top: 3rem;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: #8c7fa6;\n            text-align: center;\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(220, 208, 238, 0.4);\n            padding-top: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .footer-note strong { color: #1a0b36; font-weight: 700; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"psych-card\">\n\n        <!-- Upper Badge -->\n        <div class=\"header-badge\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"></i> Memory Mnemonic · सुपर ट्रिक\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Topic Heading -->\n        <div class=\"topic-title\">\n            <span class=\"accent\">Piaget's SPCF</span> Memory Formula\n            <span class=\"hindi-title\">(पियाजे की अवस्थाओं को याद रखने की ट्रिक)</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"topic-sub\">\n            High-Yield Sequence Accelerator · क्रमिक स्मृति सूत्र\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Mathematical Equation Layout -->\n        <div class=\"formula-box\">\n            <div class=\"f-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-root-variable\"></i> Chronological Sequence Equation</div>\n            <div class=\"math-equation\">\n                <span class=\"step\">Sensory-Motor (S)</span>\n                <span class=\"arrow\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right-long\"></i></span>\n                <span class=\"step\">Pre-Operational (P)</span>\n                <span class=\"arrow\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right-long\"></i></span>\n                <span class=\"step\">Concrete (C)</span>\n                <span class=\"arrow\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right-long\"></i></span>\n                <span class=\"step\">Formal (F)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"math-sub-timeline\">\n                <span>[ 0 - 2 Years ]</span>\n                <span>[ 2 - 7 Years ]</span>\n                <span>[ 7 - 11 Years ]</span>\n                <span>[ 11 - 15 Years+ ]</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Pointed Breakdown Grid -->\n        <div class=\"breakdown-title\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-list-check\"></i> Pointed Letter Breakdown (Bilingual)\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"school-grid\">\n            <!-- S Card -->\n            <div class=\"school-card\">\n                <div class=\"s-letter\">S <span class=\"badge\">Stage 1</span></div>\n                <div class=\"s-stage-name\">Sensory-Motor / इन्द्रियजनित गामक</div>\n                <div class=\"s-detail\">\n                    <div class=\"bullet\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i> <span><strong>Age:</strong> 0 to 2 Years (जन्म से 2 वर्ष)</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"bullet\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i> <span><strong>TET Fact:</strong> Senses are teachers. <strong>Object Permanence</strong> (वस्तु स्थायित्व) develops.</span></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- P Card -->\n            <div class=\"school-card\">\n                <div class=\"s-letter\">P <span class=\"badge\">Stage 2</span></div>\n                <div class=\"s-stage-name\">Pre-Operational / पूर्व-संक्रियात्मक</div>\n                <div class=\"s-detail\">\n                    <div class=\"bullet\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i> <span><strong>Age:</strong> 2 to 7 Years (2 से 7 वर्ष)</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"bullet\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i> <span><strong>TET Fact:</strong> Language shuru. High <strong>Egocentrism</strong> (अहंकेंद्रित सोच) &amp; <strong>Animism</strong> (जीववाद).</span></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- C Card -->\n            <div class=\"school-card\">\n                <div class=\"s-letter\">C <span class=\"badge\">Stage 3</span></div>\n                <div class=\"s-stage-name\">Concrete Operational / मूर्त संक्रियात्मक</div>\n                <div class=\"s-detail\">\n                    <div class=\"bullet\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i> <span><strong>Age:</strong> 7 to 11 Years (7 से 11 वर्ष)</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"bullet\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i> <span><strong>TET Fact:</strong> Logic begins on physical things. Achieves <strong>Reversibility</strong> (पलटावी गुण).</span></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- F Card -->\n            <div class=\"school-card\">\n                <div class=\"s-letter\">F <span class=\"badge\">Stage 4</span></div>\n                <div class=\"s-stage-name\">Formal Operational / औपचारिक संक्रियात्मक</div>\n                <div class=\"s-detail\">\n                    <div class=\"bullet\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i> <span><strong>Age:</strong> 11 to 15 Years+ (11 से 15 वर्ष+)</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"bullet\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i> <span><strong>TET Fact:</strong> Abstract thinking peaks. <strong>Hypothetico-Deductive Reasoning</strong> develops.</span></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Verbal Mnemonics Section -->\n        <div class=\"extra-section\">\n            <div class=\"extra-title\"><i class=\"fas fa-comment-dots\"></i> Alternative Sentence Mnemonics</div>\n            <div class=\"phrase-list\">\n                <div class=\"phrase-item\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-circle-check\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"phrase-words\"><strong>S</strong>ome <strong>P</strong>eople <strong>C</strong>an <strong>F</strong>ly.</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"phrase-item\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-circle-check\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"phrase-words\"><strong>S</strong>mart <strong>P</strong>arents <strong>C</strong>hoose <strong>F</strong>uture.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Footer -->\n        <div class=\"footer-note\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-graduation-cap\"></i> High-Yield TET Study Resource · <strong>SPCF Cognitive Shortcut</strong>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
